    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d187-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d187-f1-content">
                <p>Source: National Security Council, Carter
                    Administration Intelligence Files, Box I020, Minutes-SCC 1979. Secret. The meeting took place in the White House
                    Situation Room. The minutes are not attached and were not found. Dodson sent the Summary of Conclusions to
                        Mondale, Vance, Brown, Jones, and
                        Turner under a March 19 memorandum
                    signed by Carolyn Cleveland (NSC).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
